BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.88 Tm (about three months down the road, so newcomers should lock in a six-month time frame [PGvJEv9Y_Go @ 00:09:12].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 161.65 Tm (He also names state-hopping as a top killer: a beginner skip traces Florida leads, watches a guru pitch Utah, abandons) Tj ET
