BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.98 Tm (tracing source could not reach anyone or because they never learned to sell, since most courses do not coach the sales) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.75 Tm (side, and even the hobbyist route of handing signed deals to a back-end partner demands research, skip tracing and) Tj ET
